*** Settings ***
Documentation     [SUITE PURPOSE]  Verification of 5GC000522 - FR1 (cmW) band - FDD
...               Scope : DL 256QAM TCs (technical debt of 5GC000522)
...               
...               Automation author           : yann.ah.herve@nokia.com
...               Automation contact          : davide.bacchiega@nokia.com
...               Creation Date               : 30-Sept-2021
...               Modified Date               : 13-April-2022
...               Last Modified by            : otilia.mihon@nokia.com
...               Modification:
...                       30-Sept-2021        |           Creation
...                       05-Nov-2021         |           Add FDD Cases
...                       06-Dec-2021         | Because RAD param to define MCS to use are removed,
...                                           | use TM BLER to select the MCS target.
...                                           | Then all the MCS 256QAM are covered with only one TC
...                                           | (instead of 3 TCs before: one by MCS 20, 24 and 27)
...                                           | RAD param to define UL/DL rank to use removed too.
...                                           | Then only one TC, no more TCs for rank 1 and 2.
...                       07-March-2022       | Because RAD param to define MCS to use are removed,
...                                           | use TM BLER to select the MCS target.
...                                           | Then all the MCS 256QAM are covered with only 2 TCs
...                                           | (instead of 3 TCs before: 2 TCs which check MCS 20, 24 and 27 with R1 and R2)
...                                           | Bler check has been removed too.
...                                           | Removed Power Backoff RAD param. 
...                                           | Then only 2 TCs, one TC for rank 1 and and another one for rank 2.
...                       13-April-2022       | Change the name of the tests to be in line with QC modifications

